.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに前髪がこれくらい短くて動揺。\n少し幼くなったかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(そういえば！新しいチョーカーだよ♡)\n(「DAMMY」っていうブランド♡)\n(ちなみに赤のニットキャミソールは、Honey Cinnamonだよ♡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切る前はこんな感じで、とっても長かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクが薄いからかな？\n男装してるみたい...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...男装？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装...男装...だん...だ...しつ...執事...執事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(上手く繋げられず。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかの生写真のときの。\n温存していました。ずっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの前髪で\n嬉しくもあり恥ずかしくもあり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これくらいの長さだと横に流すこともできるし\n巻けば目の上にもなるし、\n色々なアレンジしたいな！と思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アレンジしたら載せるね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？のときのオフショット。\n私のお気に入り。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/07/08/8694860/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b